<title>SINGAPORE: SPC first half net profit up sharply.</title>
<headline>SPC first half net profit up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>( in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit/loss		  20.83   vs  (3.92)</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	    4.93   vs  (0.93)</p>
<p>    Turnover			  939.40   vs 842.85</p>
<p>    Interest income		   7.71   vs   6.16</p>
<p>    Interest expense		(14.98)  vs  (5.08)</p>
<p>    Associates			  1.64   vs   1.97</p>
<p>    Pretax			     23.01   vs  (3.43)</p>
<p>    Tax				   2.19   vs   0.49</p>
<p>Note- Full name is Singapore Petroleum Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
